

ONLINE-ONLY AND BRANDING NOTICE
--------------------------------
The application may require validated internet connectivity before composing its
main experience. This gate is a product behavior, not a guarantee that every
third-party provider is continuously available or realtime. Provider outages,
rate limits, DNS failures, captive portals, and network interruptions remain
possible and are surfaced through the application's LIVE, STALE, or OFFLINE
states.

The v2.5.0 interface is Indonesian-first. The bull/bear launcher artwork and
related visual assets are project branding for Mazkiplay Trade and may not be
represented as an official logo of any exchange, broker, market-data provider,
or financial institution.
